WEBVTT

00:41:29.875 --> 00:41:31.393
that are getting thrown around,

00:41:31.417 --> 00:41:33.726
so, I mean in terms
of the scale of the problem,

00:41:33.750 --> 00:41:35.559
it's probably an appropriate number.

00:41:35.583 --> 00:41:38.060
But it sounds like,
to have any chance of doing this,

00:41:38.084 --> 00:41:40.476
this would have to be
a kind of federal initiative

00:41:40.500 --> 00:41:41.893
at some level.

00:41:41.917 --> 00:41:43.268
DA: Yes.

00:41:43.292 --> 00:41:46.643
CA: We have a problem
that more than half the country

00:41:46.667 --> 00:41:49.851
fundamentally doesn't trust

00:41:49.875 --> 00:41:52.184
key parts of the administration,

00:41:52.208 --> 00:41:53.476
let's say.

00:41:53.500 --> 00:41:56.684
How could this be framed
in a way that could build trust

00:41:56.708 --> 00:42:01.018
and make it feel like
this is the country as a whole,